<nav-bar title="快速录入微信咨询" showBack/><view class="page"><view class="tip">只填称呼和微信即可保存，其余信息可稍后补充。</view><view class="form"><label>客户称呼 *</label><input data-field="nickname" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：小美" confirm-type="done" /><label>微信号或手机号 *</label><input data-field="contact" bindinput="input" placeholder="用于后续联系" confirm-type="done" /><label>咨询需求</label><textarea data-field="requirement" bindinput="input" placeholder="客户想做什么款式" confirm-type="done" /><label>预算</label><input data-field="budget" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 200–300 元" confirm-type="done" /><label>期望日期</label><picker mode="date" data-field="expectedDate" bindchange="date"><view class="field">{{expectedDate || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><label>下次跟进</label><picker mode="date" data-field="nextFollowUpAt" bindchange="date"><view class="field">{{nextFollowUpAt || '默认明天'}}</view></picker><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">保存线索</button></view></view>
